From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Long Li <longli@microsoft.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Mar 2026 12:49:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: mana: Set default number of queues to 16

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2146641

Set the default number of queues per vPort to MANA_DEF_NUM_QUEUES (16),
as 16 queues can achieve optimal throughput for typical workloads. The
actual number of queues may be lower if it exceeds the hardware reported
limit. Users can increase the number of queues up to max_queues via
ethtool if needed.

Signed-off-by: Long Li <longli@microsoft.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260323194925.1766385-1-longli@microsoft.com
Signed-off-by: Paolo Abeni <pabeni@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit 45b2b84ac6fde39c427018d6cdf7d44258938faa)
Signed-off-by: John Cabaj <john.cabaj@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Andrei Gherzan <andrei.gherzan@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Ian Whitfield <ian.whitfield@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: John Cabaj <john.cabaj@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-01337
Ledger-Origin: azure-7.0@f8e6322c2fd41049caba2348ab9e5eb93b07e22e
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/microsoft/mana/mana_en.c | 3 ++-
 include/net/mana/mana.h                       | 1 +
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/microsoft/mana/mana_en.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/microsoft/mana/mana_en.c
index 97a5d8157fd5..a75a44e3825f 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/microsoft/mana/mana_en.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/microsoft/mana/mana_en.c
@@ -3533,7 +3533,8 @@ static int mana_probe_port(struct mana_context *ac, int port_idx,
 	apc->ac = ac;
 	apc->ndev = ndev;
 	apc->max_queues = gc->max_num_queues;
-	apc->num_queues = gc->max_num_queues;
+	/* Use MANA_DEF_NUM_QUEUES as default, still honoring the HW limit */
+	apc->num_queues = min(gc->max_num_queues, MANA_DEF_NUM_QUEUES);
 	apc->tx_queue_size = DEF_TX_BUFFERS_PER_QUEUE;
 	apc->rx_queue_size = DEF_RX_BUFFERS_PER_QUEUE;
 	apc->port_handle = INVALID_MANA_HANDLE;
diff --git a/include/net/mana/mana.h b/include/net/mana/mana.h
index baedeee8f3f7..da28505a8618 100644
--- a/include/net/mana/mana.h
+++ b/include/net/mana/mana.h
@@ -1033,6 +1033,7 @@ struct mana_deregister_filter_resp {
 #define STATISTICS_FLAGS_TX_ERRORS_GDMA_ERROR		0x0000000004000000
 
 #define MANA_MAX_NUM_QUEUES 64
+#define MANA_DEF_NUM_QUEUES 16
 
 #define MANA_SHORT_VPORT_OFFSET_MAX ((1U << 8) - 1)
 
